berry tart."&lt;SEP&gt;"HaileyJohnson is a person who delivers fresh bread to Li Hua and engages in a friendly conversation about the delivery."&lt;SEP&gt;"HaileyJohnson is a person who initiates a Mother’s Day promotion and coordinates the delivery of pastries and cakes."&lt;SEP&gt;"HaileyJohnson is a person who organized an event and is communicating with Li Hua about the voting for the event's dessert options."&lt;SEP&gt;"HaileyJohnson is a person who runs a business offering a new weekly flavor of Hazelnut Basque Roasted Cheese and is engaging in a conversation with Li Hua about it."&lt;SEP&gt;"HaileyJohnson is the organizer of a free baking class, initiating the conversation and expressing excitement about the event."&lt;SEP&gt;"HaileyJohnson is the owner of a bakery who interacts with LiHua, offers doorstep deliveries, and experiments with new flavors."&lt;SEP&gt;"HaileyJohnson is the owner of a shop that provides doorstep delivery service for milk and bread, and has hired a new clerk named Alice."&lt;SEP&gt;"HaileyJohnson is the person launching a new line of gluten-free bread options and communicating with Li Hua about its availability."&lt;SEP&gt;"HaileyJohnson is a person who launched a new line of high-protein breads and is communicating with Li Hua about the product."&lt;SEP&gt;"HaileyJohnson is a person who showcased a new banana durian cheesecake and is responsible for delivering it to LiHua."&lt;SEP&gt;"HaileyJohnson is a person who created a new bread recipe and invited LiHua to taste it at the bakery."</data>
