ace during runs."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sage is a fitness enthusiast who uses a 5-minute jump rope session followed by leg swings and side lunges as part of their warm-up routine."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sage is a participant in a fitness discussion, sharing favorite outdoor exercises like burpees, push-ups, and sprints."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sage is a participant in the workout class who focuses on mobility drills and shares their warm-up routine."</data>
