    <node id="&quot;FIONNUALA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Fionnuala enjoys diving deep into game characters and looks forward to future discussions and analyses."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fionnuala is a participant in the discussion, discussing the potential for connection and support in Dutch's later stages and its impact on his downfall."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fionnuala is a participant in the discussion, expressing interest in the game's power system and how it will balance with exploration and combat."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fionnuala is a participant in the discussion, providing insights on games like 'Mass Effect Legendary Edition', 'Final Fantasy XVI', and 'Hollow Knight', emphasizing the emotional impact of their soundtracks."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fionnuala is a participant in the discussion, sharing her positive experience with the Control Center and engaging in conversations about game mechanics and recommendations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fionnuala is a player who shares a hilarious glitch where Arthur floats in mid-air during a cutscene."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fionnuala is interested in a good matchmaking system and a solid tutorial or training mode to enhance the gameplay experience."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fionnuala is a participant in the discussion who discusses how emotional ties with NPCs make gaming experiences unforgettable and influence replay value."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fionnuala is a participant in the discussion, describing an unexpected dragon fight in 'Skyrim' while on a quest, resulting in a chaotic and exciting experience."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fionnuala is a participant in the discussion, highlighting the immersive and surreal nature of the forested areas through sound and visuals."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fionnuala is a participant in the discussion, suggesting ideas for game mechanics and character roles, particularly focusing on intelligence-based characters and gameplay diversity."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fionnuala is a participant who praises "All Ghillied Up" and discusses the emotional impact of missions in Call of Duty games."&lt;SEP&gt;"Fionnuala is a participant who shares her experience with the 'What Lies Unseen' quest and the emotional impact of choices."</data>
